Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Build coordinated implementation packages covering procurement, stock, production, documentation, and field actions as applicable. Sequence changes to avoid incompatible mixed configurations and identify irreversible dispositions requiring separate authorization.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
